      "text": "Pehle: 5 apps × 20 tools = 100 custom integrations. Har app ko har\ntool ke liye alag code likhna padta tha.\n\nMCP ke baad: 5 + 20 = 25. Ek baar server likho — Claude Code,\nClaude Desktop, Cursor, tumhara custom agent, sab use kar sakte hain.\nYahi poora point hai. Baaki sab implementation detail hai.",
      "originalText": "Pehle: 5 apps × 20 tools = 100 custom integrations. Har app ko har\ntool ke liye alag code likhna padta tha.\n\nMCP ke baad: 5 + 20 = 25. Ek baar server likho — Claude Code,\nClaude Desktop, Cursor, tumhara custom agent, sab use kar sakte hain.\nYahi poora point hai. Baaki sab implementation detail hai.",
