      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Server ke tool DESCRIPTIONS tumhare prompt mein jaate hain.\n   Untrusted server = direct prompt injection surface.\n2. Tool RESULTS bhi untrusted data hain — unme instructions ho sakti hain.\n3. Defence CODE mein rakho, prompt mein nahi: server allowlist,\n   tool allowlist, permission gate, scoped credentials, audit log.\n4. 'Ye MCP server accha lag raha hai' ≠ 'ye safe hai'. Code padho.",
      "originalText": "1. Server ke tool DESCRIPTIONS tumhare prompt mein jaate hain.\n   Untrusted server = direct prompt injection surface.\n2. Tool RESULTS bhi untrusted data hain — unme instructions ho sakti hain.\n3. Defence CODE mein rakho, prompt mein nahi: server allowlist,\n   tool allowlist, permission gate, scoped credentials, audit log.\n4. 'Ye MCP server accha lag raha hai' ≠ 'ye safe hai'. Code padho.",
